6-T7-T8 chow. Keeping the hand concealed preserves options for Fully Concealed Hand (4 points) and Two Concealed Pungs (2 points). Exposing T7 pung now would lock me into a specific pattern with lower scoring potential and reduce strategic flexibility for achieving higher-value patterns.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
